{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"void_witch","model_identifier":"void_witch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# void_witch\n\nVoid witch (C3), floating caster, 2.2 m = 78 u to the crown tips (head top 76 u; the drifting hair rises higher). Hovers: the smoke tail ends about 3 u above y = 0.\n\nA purple demon witch, not a player mage: torn purple-and-black robes that fade down through ragged tatters into grey-violet smoke instead of legs (robe_1 > robe_2 > robe_3 bone chain), grey-violet skin, violet eyes, long white hair drifting upward (hair_1 > hair_2), a crown of black thorns and glowing violet hands (fx_hand_r / fx_hand_l). Baseline humanoid upper-body skeleton and slot names (leg bones present but empty).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 3.0..94.0, z -4.5..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 74 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 4\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `float` | 1.6 | loop | gliding, leaning into the move, robes and hair trailing (loop) |\n| `cast_drain` | 1.2 | loop | held beam pose (loop while channelling): beams from fx_hand_r and fx_hand_l to the target |\n| `hex` | 1.2 | once | key 0.6 s: the hex lands on the target as she points |\n| `blink` | 1 | once | shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.5 s: move her then), reappears 0.5-0.8 s; scale keys on root |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | rises, arms spread |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | recoil |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | the light goes out, she sinks and folds forward over her crumpled smoke; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `float`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s) gliding; replaces walk and run\n\n## Key times\n\n- `hex`: key 0.6 s: the hex lands on the target as she points\n- `blink`: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.5 s: move her then), reappears 0.5-0.8 s; scale keys on root\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 76, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 39.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.25, 47.25, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 39.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 43, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 43, 2.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 39, 0)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 39, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and the hands (handglow material, flat bright) are lit.\n- Uses `scale` keys on root in blink.\n"},"description":"# void_witch\n\nVoid witch (C3), floating caster, 2.2 m = 78 u to the crown tips (head top 76 u; the drifting hair rises higher). Hovers: the smoke tail ends about 3 u above y = 0.\n\nA purple demon witch, not a player mage: torn purple-and-black robes that fade down through ragged tatters into grey-violet smoke instead of legs (robe_1 > robe_2 > robe_3 bone chain), grey-violet skin, violet eyes, long white hair drifting upward (hair_1 > hair_2), a crown of black thorns and glowing violet hands (fx_hand_r / fx_hand_l). Baseline humanoid upper-body skeleton and slot names (leg bones present but empty).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 3.0..94.0, z -4.5..7.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 74 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 4\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop |  |\n| `float` | 1.6 | loop | gliding, leaning into the move, robes and hair trailing (loop) |\n| `cast_drain` | 1.2 | loop | held beam pose (loop while channelling): beams from fx_hand_r and fx_hand_l to the target |\n| `hex` | 1.2 | once | key 0.6 s: the hex lands on the target as she points |\n| `blink` | 1 | once | shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.5 s: move her then), reappears 0.5-0.8 s; scale keys on root |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | rises, arms spread |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | recoil |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | the light goes out, she sinks and folds forward over her crumpled smoke; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `float`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s) gliding; replaces walk and run\n\n## Key times\n\n- `hex`: key 0.6 s: the hex lands on the target as she points\n- `blink`: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.5 s: move her then), reappears 0.5-0.8 s; scale keys on root\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 76, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 39.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.25, 47.25, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 39.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 43, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 43, 2.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 39, 0)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 39, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and the hands (handglow material, flat bright) are lit.\n- Uses `scale` keys on root in blink.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,40.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,46.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,40.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[42,37,52.0,43.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[110,37,116.0,43.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv